<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Black Hills Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Black Hills Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber raised its rating on Black Hills Corp to attractive from neutral, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 at 25-3/4.</p>
</text>
